2. FastNoiseSIMD -- the features that only this library had (classic Simplex,
   Billow, RigidMulti, white noise, the cellular Natural distance and
   NoiseLookup and Distance2Cave returns, gradient perturb) are implemented to
   reproduce its behaviour, for example its hash, gradient selection and skew
   for classic Simplex, and are checked against vectors captured from it.
   https://github.com/Auburn/FastNoiseSIMD

